{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-product","blocks":{"title":{"type":"title","settings":{}},"caption":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"{{ product.metafields.descriptors.subtitle.value }}","text_style":"subtitle"}},"1b158f69-6012-451e-bf40-a205c86b3682":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/yotpo-product-reviews\/blocks\/star-rating\/eb7dfd7d-db44-4334-bc49-c893b51b36cf","settings":{"product":"{{product}}"}},"price":{"type":"price","settings":{}},"description":{"type":"description","settings":{}},"variant_picker":{"type":"variant_picker","settings":{"picker_type":"button"}},"fd35310f-a903-4f2a-aa78-92f345583144":{"type":"link","settings":{"title":"{{ product.metafields.custom.link_to_title.value }}"}},"quantity_selector":{"type":"quantity_selector","settings":{}},"buy_buttons":{"type":"buy_buttons","settings":{"show_sticky_cart":true,"is_set":false,"only_tier_gang_button":"Required gang tier not reached","set_size":3,"set_text":"Wähle 3 Produkte","show_dynamic_checkout":false,"gang_url":"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/account\/login"}},"wishlist_engine_product_page_8jtrgP":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/se-wishlist-engine\/blocks\/Product-Page\/8f7c0857-8e71-463d-a168-8e133094753b","disabled":true,"settings":{}},"klarna_on_site_messaging_app_block_fqwWU9":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/klarna-on-site-messaging\/blocks\/app-block\/b95936a9-74b6-4a95-8103-6a1b6459c25e","settings":{"data_key":"top-strip-promotion-badge","theme":"default","topPadding":"0","bottomPadding":"0","messagePrefix":""}},"recommended_products_iwcmrz":{"type":"recommended_products","settings":{"title":"The Perfect Gifting","content":"","button_text":"Add all to cart","product_list":["starter-kit-700ml","strawberries-cream"],"enable_bulk_add":false,"columns_desktop":"2","enable_desktop_slider":false,"columns_mobile":"2","swipe_on_mobile":false}},"collapsible-row-2":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Description","icon":"clipboard","content":"<p>Our sell out community flavour from 2023! <\/p><p>After completely selling out 2 years running, our Strawberry & Rhubarb Moonshine is once again available in our online store! <\/p><p>Perfect paired with prosecco or as a sweet addition to a gin & tonic, whether you drink the Strawberry & Rhubarb Moonshine as part of a cocktail or neat over ice, it's always a treat. Ideal for long summer evenings with friends or sipping around a barbecue.<\/p><p>Bottled in traditional Mason Jars, we promise a unique drinking experience. If you would like to discover <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/collections\/moonshine\">more high quality liqueurs<\/a>, have a look at our entire product range. Become part of our <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/pages\/gang\" title=\"O'Donnell Gang\">Moonshine Gang<\/a> to collect proof points and unlock unique benefits.<\/p><p>For those new to Moonshine, it was the name given to illegally produced grain alcohol distilled during the American Prohibition. It was traditionally bottled in Mason Jars to avoid detection by the authorities. O’Donnell Moonshine retains the rebellious nature of that era, while delivering a whole new world of flavour in our range of smooth and delicious liqueurs.<\/p><h5>*Consult our <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/pages\/faq\">FAQ's<\/a> for more information.<\/h5>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-3":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Perfect Serve","icon":"bottle","content":"<h3>Strawberry-Rhubarb Fizz<\/h3><h4>Ingredients<\/h4><ul><li>60ml Strawberry-Rhubarb<\/li><li>20 ml Lime Juice<\/li><li>Soda to top <\/li><\/ul><h4>Recipe<\/h4><p>Add a generous measure of Strawberry-Rhubarb to a glass with ice. Add 20 ml fresh lime juice and top with soda or tonic to taste. Garnish with fresh strawberries and a slice of lime. <br\/><br\/>You can find more recipes in our <a href=\"\/blogs\/cocktails\" title=\"Cocktails\">cocktail blog<\/a>.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_tab_K6wP7N":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Allergens","icon":"nut_free","content":"<p>All of our Moonshines, unless indicated otherwise, are allergen free in accordance with Regulation (EU) No 1169\/2011 and amendments. All of our products, unless stated otherwise, are suitable for vegans and those with a gluten intolerance.<\/p><p>All of our spirits are produced using wheat based alcohol. While the distillation process removes gluten from the final product, individuals with certain conditions (i.e coeliac disease) may wish to exercise caution prior to purchase.<br\/><br\/>You can find more recipes in our <a href=\"\/blogs\/cocktails\" title=\"Cocktails\">cocktail blog<\/a>.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-1":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Our Loyalty Scheme - The Gang","icon":"silhouette","content":"<p>Join our loyalty scheme 'The Gang' <a href=\"\/pages\/gang\" title=\"O'Donnell Gang\">here<\/a> to earn points, receive some amazing rewards and gain early access to exciting new products!<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-0":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Shipping","icon":"truck","content":"<p><strong>£3.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&lt; <\/strong>2kg<br\/><strong>£5.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&gt; <\/strong>2kg<\/p><p><strong>Free shipping<\/strong> for orders over £70!<\/p><p>Shipping cost to Northern Ireland is set at £16.95<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["title","caption","1b158f69-6012-451e-bf40-a205c86b3682","price","description","variant_picker","fd35310f-a903-4f2a-aa78-92f345583144","quantity_selector","buy_buttons","wishlist_engine_product_page_8jtrgP","klarna_on_site_messaging_app_block_fqwWU9","recommended_products_iwcmrz","collapsible-row-2","collapsible-row-3","collapsible_tab_K6wP7N","collapsible-row-1","collapsible-row-0"],"settings":{"gift_card_receipient_enabled":false,"is_above_the_fold":true,"enable_sticky_info":true,"badges_enabled":false,"gallery_layout":"thumbnail","media_size":"small","mobile_thumbnails":"hide","hide_variants":true,"enable_video_looping":false,"padding_top":24,"padding_bottom":12}},"image-with-text":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"image-with-text-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Chosen By You!","heading_size":"h2"}},"image-with-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>A sell out flavour 2 years running! Our first Community Edition, first launched in 2023, Strawberry-Rhubarb was selected by our fans, for our fans and has been a firm favourite ever since!<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["image-with-text-0","image-with-text-1"],"settings":{"is_above_the_fold":false,"background_color":"#ffffff","text_color":"#000000","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/UK_Rhababeera_Comeback_1x1_02.jpg","image_caption":"","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":24,"padding_bottom":12}},"f1ea0866-fcfa-41f3-8ae9-84fae6d01566":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--17963898274060__f1ea0866-fcfa-41f3-8ae9-84fae6d01566-1684837189c45d6eeb-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Your Moonshine, Your Way!","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--17963898274060__f1ea0866-fcfa-41f3-8ae9-84fae6d01566-1684837189c45d6eeb-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Strawberry & Rhubarb is full of fresh fruit flavour and zing, and makes for a refreshing sip over ice.  For those of you who prefer a longer drink, we have loads of mixes and cocktail suggestions, ready for you to try out!<\/p>","text_style":"body"}},"template--17963898274060__f1ea0866-fcfa-41f3-8ae9-84fae6d01566-1684837189c45d6eeb-2":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"Discover All Cocktails","button_link":"shopify:\/\/blogs\/cocktails","button_style_white_color":false}}},"block_order":["template--17963898274060__f1ea0866-fcfa-41f3-8ae9-84fae6d01566-1684837189c45d6eeb-0","template--17963898274060__f1ea0866-fcfa-41f3-